---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy · Yoga Shakti" description="How Yoga Shakti with Ashish Anant handles data and analytics.">
  <main class="wrap page">
    <div class="kicker">Privacy</div>
    <h1>Privacy note</h1>
    <p>We keep this simple. This site uses cookies only for anonymous analytics, and only if you accept. Declining is completely fine — the site works the same either way.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>If you accept analytics, we record anonymous usage (which links are tapped, and the channel you came from) to understand what's helpful. We do not sell data or run advertising here.</p>

    <h2>Forms &amp; sign-ups</h2>
    <p>When you fill a form to join a session or workshop, the details you provide go only to us, to send you the session link and related information. You can ask us to delete your details at any time.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For any privacy request, reach out via any of the channels linked on the home page.</p>

  </main>
</Base>
